  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "==================\nv1.4.0 && v1.3.3\n==================\n\nNEW FEATURES\n------------\n\n1. GodotSharpDI.Runtime Runtime Library\n   ------------------------------------\n   Extracted runtime logic from generated Scope code into a standalone library.\n   This significantly reduces generated code size and improves maintainability.\n\n   New classes:\n     - InjectionExecutor:       Central injection execution with separate try-catch\n     - AsyncProviderRunner:     Runs async [Provide] methods\n     - SyncProviderRunner:      Runs synchronous [Provide] methods\n     - WaitForCoordinator:      Coordinates WaitFor with Interlocked countdown\n     - DeadlockDetector:        Runtime circular dependency detection (DEBUG only)\n     - ServiceCacheEntry:       Volatile state + instance cache entry\n     - DependencyWaitInfo:      WaitFor dependency metadata\n     - ErrorReporter:           Centralized error/warning reporting\n\n\nBUG FIXES\n---------\n\n1. InjectionExecutor assign failure reporting\n   -------------------------------------------\n   Fixed: When [Inject] member assignment threw an exception, WaitFor callbacks\n   were incorrectly notified as success. Now correctly reports failure and skips\n   ReadyCallback.\n\n\nINTERNAL IMPROVEMENTS\n---------------------\n\n- Code Generator: Reduced complexity by delegating to Runtime library\n- CircularDependencyDetector: Extracted reusable TarjanSCC<T> algorithm\n- Thread Safety: volatile fields, Interlocked operations\n- New Runtime test project with 35 tests\n- Documentation: Fixed callback signatures and descriptions\n\nARCHITECTURE CHANGES\n--------------------\n\n- New GodotSharpDI.CodeFixes project: Extracted code fix providers\n  (InjectionFailureCallbackCodeFixProvider, NotificationMethodCodeFixProvider)\n  from SourceGenerator into an independent project\n\n- New GodotSharpDI.Shared project: Extracted shared resources and constants\n  (GlobalNames, ShortNames, TypeNamesFull, Resources) from SourceGenerator\n  into an independent project\n\n- GeneratedStrings moved from Shared to Internal/Coding namespace\n\n\nBREAKING CHANGES (v1.3.3, merged into this release)\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n- [Modules] attribute: named property syntax removed, use constructor params",
